      "name": "Measure a translated texture",
      "description": "DAISY measures local gradients on two 16-pixel grids. The train grid is shifted 8 pixels right and 6 down. The matcher pairs rows by L2 distance, and the evaluator checks every match against the known translation. Both images are original MIT assets.",
